          "jcr:created": "Wed Oct 18 2023 17:40:52 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Shapeable/reshapeable tip</b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Transend Guidewires' design utilizes a 2cm, tapered-ribbon corewire tip, engineered to permit repeated tip shaping and reshaping</span></p>\n",
