          "jcr:created": "Wed Oct 18 2023 17:40:52 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Scitanium Corewire Designed for Access</b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Transend corewires are engineered to enhance torque transmission and distal support allowing orientation of formed tip for precise vessel selection and positioning</span><br>\n</p>\n",
